This notice is retained because this repository adapts code from the package
`ascii.rest@0.4.0` (MIT, bas3line). The copy above is the package's own LICENSE
file, kept verbatim. The adaptation is listed, with the upstream source file it
came from, in `scripts/scene-src/adoption-ledger.json`, and the checker
`scripts/check-scene-engine.mjs` fails if the ledger and the code disagree in
either direction (a listed entry must exist in the code; library-derived
material in the code must be listed).

The installed package itself is not modified and keeps its own LICENSE at
`node_modules/ascii.rest/LICENSE`.
